   Params: days (default 30), type (indicator_type string)
   → { success, data: Array<{date, value}> }

3. GET /api/admin/recommendation-rules
   → { success, data: RecommendationRule[] }

4. POST /api/admin/recommendation-rules
   Body: { priority, signal, logicOperator, conditions, reasonTemplate }
   Validate:
     - priority: number > 0
     - signal: one of STRONG_WATCH/WATCH/OBSERVE/CAUTION/WEAK
     - logicOperator: 'AND' | 'OR'
     - conditions: array with at least 1 item
     - each condition has field/operator/value
   → 201 { success, data: RecommendationRule }
   → 422 if validation fails

5. PUT /api/admin/recommendation-rules/[id]
   → 200 { success, data: updated rule }
   → 404 if not found

6. DELETE /api/admin/recommendation-rules/[id]
   (soft delete: sets is_active = false)
   → 200 { success, data: { deactivated: true } }

7. GET /api/snapshots
   Params: limit (default 30, max 90)
   → { success, data: SnapshotSummary[] }

8. GET /api/snapshots/[date]/coins
   Date format: YYYY-MM-DD
   → { success, data: CoinSnapshotPoint[] }

9. GET /api/snapshots/[date]/narratives
   → { success, data: NarrativeSnapshotPoint[] }

